<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-371707">Fe(s) + Cu(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>(aq) &rarr; Fe(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>(aq) + Cu(s)</p>

